    "calculation_formula": {
        "description": "Premium bookmark printing with complex tiered margins, optional celloglaze, and double GST application",
        "steps": [
            "1. Calculate artwork setup cost: _a = artworks * 15, _a2 = IF _a <= 15 THEN 0 ELSE (_a - 15)",
            "2. Calculate celloglaze setup cost: IF celloglaze != 'None' THEN 25 ELSE 0",
            "3. Calculate total setup cost: impos_setup (15) + guilo_setup (12) + artwork_setup + celloglaze_setup",
            "4. Calculate sheet costs: ((quantity / sheets_per_1000) / 1000) * paper_stock_price * stock_waste (1.05)",
            "5. Calculate total sheets printed: (quantity / sheets_per_1000) * stock_waste",
            "6. Calculate click cost: total_sheets_printed * print_type_price",
            "7. Calculate cutting cost: total_sheets_printed / cutting_block (500) * cut_cost (11)",
            "8. Calculate celloglaze cost: IF celloglaze != 'None' THEN total_sheets_printed * celloglaze_price ELSE 0",
            "9. Calculate subtotal: setup_cost + sheet_costs + click_cost + cutting_cost + celloglaze_cost",
            "10. Determine profit margin based on subtotal using 12 different tiers",
            "11. Apply margin: subtotal + (subtotal * profit_margin)",
            "12. Apply GST: result * 1.1",
            "13. Apply final multiplier: result * 1.1 (total GST effect: 21%)"
        ]
    },
